    {
      "name": "Evidence method control",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "evidence-method",
      "description": "Selects graph evidence or vector baseline in the evidence pane.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-methods\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Retrieval method\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\">Graph evidence</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">Vector baseline</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-methods{display:inline-flex;align-items:stretch;gap:2px;padding:3px;background:#1a1511;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-methods button{background:none;border:1px solid transparent;padding:6px 8px;color:var(--quiet,#b5a99e);min-height:34px;font:600 .72rem/1.5 \"Bricolage Grotesque Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-methods button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--paper,#131211);color:var(--ink,#faf7f2);border-color:var(--border,#3a3029)}.ds-methods button:hover{color:var(--ink,#faf7f2);text-decoration:underline}.ds-methods button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#ff6a1a);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Work panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "work-panel",
      "description": "Charcoal panel for standard incident or report content.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h3>Evidence briefing</h3><p>Review the related incident before applying a fix.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border,#3a3029);border-radius:var(--radius,5px);background:var(--paper,#131211);color:var(--ink,#faf7f2);font:14px/1.5 \"Bricolage Grotesque Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-panel h3{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.012em}.ds-panel p{margin:5px 0 0;max-width:72ch;color:var(--quiet,#b5a99e)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Featured incident evidence",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "featured-evidence",
      "description": "Shows a connected precedent, its confirmed reason, endpoints, and relationship action.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-featured\"><div class=\"ds-source\"><span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M28.195 20.575h1.52v6.09h-1.52Zm-1.53 6.09h1.53v1.53h-1.53Zm0-7.61h1.53v1.52h-1.53Zm-1.52-1.53h1.52v1.53h-1.52Zm-4.57 10.67h6.09v1.52h-6.09Zm3.04-12.19h1.53v1.52h-1.53Zm-4.57-1.53h4.57v1.53h-4.57Zm0 12.19h1.53v1.53h-1.53Zm-1.52-1.52h1.52v1.52h-1.52Z\"/><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M14.475 11.435h-3.05v3.04h1.53v1.53h1.52v1.52h1.53v1.53h1.52v1.52h3.05v-3.05h-1.53v-1.52h-1.52v-1.53h-1.52v-1.52h-1.53zm1.53 12.19h1.52v1.52h-1.52Zm0-15.24h1.52v4.57h-1.52Z\"/><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M14.475 19.055h1.53v4.57h-1.53Zm0-12.19h1.53v1.52h-1.53Zm-1.52-1.53h1.52v1.53h-1.52Zm-1.53-1.52h1.53v1.52h-1.53Zm-3.04 12.19h4.57v1.52h-4.57Zm-1.53-1.53h1.53v1.53h-1.53Zm-1.52-12.19h6.09v1.53h-6.09Zm0 10.67h1.52v1.52h-1.52Zm-1.52-1.52h1.52v1.52h-1.52Zm0-7.62h1.52v1.52h-1.52Zm-1.53 1.52h1.53v6.1h-1.53Z\"/></svg> Connected precedent</span><span>Container Registry</span></div><h3><button>Registry uploads stalled after a policy rollout</button></h3><p>A responder confirmed both incidents recovered after restoring the previous configuration.</p><div class=\"ds-path\"><span>INC-142</span><span class=\"ds-edge\"><i></i>SAME_FIX_AS<i></i></span><span>INC-089</span><button>Inspect relationship</button></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-featured{border:1px solid #6d412b;border-radius:7px;background:#27180f;color:var(--ink,#faf7f2);padding:clamp(16px,2.4vw,27px);font:14px/1.5 \"Bricolage Grotesque Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-source{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px 12px;color:#ddbaa4;font-size:.73rem}.ds-source span:first-child{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:#ffad7b;font-weight:600}.ds-source span+span{border-left:1px solid #5c3726;padding-left:10px}.ds-featured h3{font:650 clamp(1.65rem,2.95vw,2.45rem)/1.06 \"Bricolage Grotesque Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.025em;max-width:25ch;margin:9px 0}.ds-featured h3 button{padding:0;border:0;background:none;color:inherit;font:inherit;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-featured h3 button:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-featured p{max-width:55ch;margin:0;color:#ddbaa4;font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.55}.ds-path{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px 9px;padding-top:13px;margin-top:15px;border-top:1px solid #67412c;color:#ffd2b5}.ds-path span{font:500 .72rem \"IBM Plex Mono\",monospace}.ds-path .ds-edge{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:.66rem;color:#ffa06f}.ds-edge i{width:9px;height:1px;background:var(--accent,#ff6a1a)}.ds-path button{margin-left:auto;color:#ffb087;border:0;background:none;padding:4px 0 4px 4px;text-decoration:underline;font:inherit;font-size:.76rem;cursor:pointer}.ds-featured :focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ffc2a0;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:420px){.ds-path button{margin-left:0;flex-basis:100%;text-align:left;padding-left:0}}"
    },
